  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s 1/4 Zip Tactical Airsoft Combat Shirt is the ultimate gear for airsoft and paintball enthusiasts. Constructed with a breathable, lightweight, and resilient material blend, this shirt enhances mobility and provides long-lasting wear, making it ideal for extended, intense games. The &frac14;-zip closure allows you to adjust the collar&rsquo;s fit around your neck, whether wearing the shirt alone or as a base layer under a tactical vest.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133005",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s 1/4 Zip Tactical Airsoft Combat Shirt is the ultimate gear for airsoft and paintball enthusiasts. Constructed with a breathable, lightweight, and resilient material blend, this shirt enhances mobility and provides long-lasting wear, making it ideal for extended, intense games. The &frac14;-zip closure allows you to adjust the collar&rsquo;s fit around your neck, whether wearing the shirt alone or as a base layer under a tactical vest. The mock turtleneck and mandarin collar design offer comfort and neck protection from chafing while wearing body armor. Zippered sleeve pockets on each shoulder provide easy access to smaller gear, while reinforced padded elbow patches prevent abrasion. Gusseted sleeves improve your range of motion, and loop fields on the right shoulder pocket are perfect for attaching name, rank, and flag patches. A glint tape holder on the left sleeve is ideal for attaching IR (infrared) tape. Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and military personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>",
